</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2482fdb0-7ddf-11f1-9ce5-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-12T083107Z-212065747-RC25CMA1A4YX-RTRMADP-3-IRAN-CRISIS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/2482fdb0-7ddf-11f1-9ce5-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-12T083107Z-212065747-RC25CMA1A4YX-RTRMADP-3-IRAN-CRISIS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">1ceb1138-7df2-11f1-8dd2-11e35dee156f</guid><pubDate>Sun, 12 Jul 2026 13:08:38 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>林兰</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
